---
import Portfolio from '../layouts/Portfolio.astro';
---
<Portfolio page="experiments" route="experiments/" title="Experiments — Interactive tools by Shubham Shinde" description="Interactive tools, creative coding and visual experiments by Shubham Shinde, design lead and art director in Bengaluru, India.">
  <section class="page-intro experiments-intro"><div class="experiments-intro-label">Custom tools · Made with AI</div><div><h1>Experiments</h1><p>Tools built from my concepts, with a showcase of what each one can make.</p></div></section>
  <section class="experiments-list" aria-label="Custom AI-built tools and their showcases">
    <article class="experiment">
      <a class="experiment-art" href="experiments/dither-boil/" aria-label="Open Dither Boil"><video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="experiments/dither-boil/preview.jpg" aria-label="Animated dither effect on an archer illustration"><source src="experiments/dither-boil/preview.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video></a>
      <div><p class="experiment-kicker">01 / Image to motion</p><h2>Dither Boil</h2><p>Upload an image or clip, shape its animated 1-bit grain, and export a loop. The preview shows a real result made with the tool.</p><div class="experiment-links"><a class="pill" href="experiments/dither-boil/">Try the tool ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="journal/dither-tool/">Tool + showcase story</a></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="experiment">
      <a class="experiment-art" href="experiments/happy-diwali-3d/" aria-label="Open the Happy Diwali 3D greeting"><img src="experiments/happy-diwali-3d/assets/night.png" alt="Night scene from the interactive 3D Diwali greeting" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080"></a>
      <div><p class="experiment-kicker">02 / Personalised greeting</p><h2>Happy Diwali, in 3D</h2><p>A greeting tool you can explore, flip and personalise. The day and night scenes showcase its 3D world; Tripo generated the models.</p><div class="experiment-links"><a class="pill" href="experiments/happy-diwali-3d/">Try the tool ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="journal/happy-diwali-3d-card/">Tool + showcase story</a></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="experiment">
      <a class="experiment-art" href="journal/diwali-isometric-motion/" aria-label="Watch the Diwali isometric motion study"><img src="assets/journal/diwali/kandil-poster.jpg" alt="A Diwali diya, anar, chakri, kandil and kamal arranged on a dark isometric grid" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080"></a>
      <div><p class="experiment-kicker">03 / Festival effects</p><h2>Diwali effects</h2><p>A personalised Diwali effects experience built from my concept, with an isometric motion film as its showcase.</p><div class="experiment-links"><a class="pill" href="journal/diwali-isometric-motion/">View the showcase ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="journal/diwali-isometric-motion/">Tool + showcase story</a></div></div>
    </article>
  </section>
  <p class="journal-invite">More process notes and project stories live in the <a href="journal/">Journal ↗</a>.</p>
</Portfolio>
<style>
.experiments-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,.65fr) minmax(0,1.35fr);gap:0;max-width:1560px;margin:auto;padding-bottom:48px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.experiments-intro-label{padding:8px 24px 0 0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)}.experiments-intro>div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:clamp(24px,5vw,72px)}.experiments-intro h1{margin:0}.experiments-intro>div+div>p{max-width:600px;margin-bottom:0}
.experiments-list{padding:0 var(--pad) 56px;max-width:1560px;margin:auto;display:grid;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.experiment{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.65fr) minmax(280px,.75fr);gap:0;align-items:stretch;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.experiment-art{display:flex;min-height:360px;aspect-ratio:16/8.5;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.experiment-art img,.experiment-art video{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}.experiment>div{align-self:center;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,54px)}.experiment h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4.3vw,64px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0 0 18px}.experiment p{max-width:520px}.experiment-kicker{font-size:.74rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}.experiment-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-top:28px}.experiment-links .text-link{color:inherit;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:4px}.experiment:focus-within .experiment-art{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:4px}.journal-invite{padding:0 var(--pad) 100px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}.journal-invite a{color:var(--ink)}
@media(max-width:760px){.experiments-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;padding-top:42px;padding-bottom:32px}.experiments-intro-label{padding:0}.experiments-intro>div+div{border-left:0;padding-left:0}.experiments-list{padding-bottom:40px}.experiment{grid-template-columns:1fr}.experiment-art{min-height:0;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.experiment>div{padding:24px 4px 30px}.experiment-links{margin-top:22px}}
</style>
<script>
const preview=document.querySelector('.experiment-art video');
if(preview instanceof HTMLVideoElement){const reduce=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');const sync=()=>{if(reduce.matches){preview.pause();preview.removeAttribute('autoplay')}else preview.play().catch(()=>{})};sync();reduce.addEventListener('change',sync)}
</script>
